            "title": "ROUND 2: US, China announce newest round of tariffs as Trump's ...",
            "snippets": [
              "The Trump administration announced that the US will impose a 25% tariff on an additional $16 billion worth of Chinese goods starting August 23. China replied with a tariff on US goods of equal size and scope. The move and countermove are the latest in the growing trade war between Trump and China.",
              "# ROUND 2: US, China announce newest round of tariffs as Trump's trade war shows no sign of slowing down\n## Follow Bob Bryan\n- **The US will impose a 25% tariff on $16 billion worth of Chinese goods starting August 23.**\n- **The tariff will mostly apply to industrial equipment, like tractors and chemicals.**\n- **In response, the Chinese government also announced a 25% tariff on $16 billion worth of US goods that will go into effect the same day.**",
              "The US and China rolled out a new wave of tariffs as the trade war between the two countries rolls on.\n\nThe US will impose a 25% tariff on another $16 billion worth of Chinese goods starting August 23, US Trade Representative Robert Lighthizer announced Tuesday",
              "The new set of measures are the second tranche of tariffs that President Donald Trump originally announced in March, following an initial round of tariffs on $34 billion worth of Chinese imports that went into effect in early July. It represents the latest salvo in the ever-expanding trade war between the US and China",
