              "Congress, including House Ways and Means Committee Chairman Kevin Brady (R-TX) and Senate Finance Committee Chairman Orrin Hatch (R-UT), have expressed concerns and are urging the president to come up with a solution that will establish a fair trade relationship between the two economic powers.\n\nThe latest announcement by USTR sets forth the following timeline for public comment and consideration of the potential new tariffs:",
